Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Altitude 2,400. Speed 28,000. Relative to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving Earth atmosphere. Switching to space speed 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really save Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting cold feet, Tactical Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship off our starboard bow. It's a friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"We pray for your safe journey."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now pass through lunar orbit, and head for Mars, at cruising speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon arrival, main staff are to gather in the central operations room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be a briefing on the warp test. That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the impact observation team. A Teron ship has left orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we send the fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let's see what it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What does an inferior race, who cannot even leave their own solar system,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,plan to do with a single ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to watch and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, the journey to Iscandar and back would take 336,000 years, at light speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And we must complete that voyage within a single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To do this, we require faster-than-light warp navigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,capable of breaking the light barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:04:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A warp functions by generating an artificial wormhole,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,that allows travel beyond the speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't fully understand this, but is it even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Theoretically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you botch the timing, you'll create a space-time continuum distortion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and phase transition the universe itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning what, in practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That we must be very careful with the Wave Motion Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting cold feet, Navigation Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.27,0:04:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Niimi, the Engineering Intelligence Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have completed a weapon, capable of harnessing the Wave Motion Engine's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,vast power, and have loaded it aboard the Yamato's bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dimensional Wave Motion Explosive Compression Emitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We call it the Wave Motion Gun for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Gun? How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Put simply,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it extends the higher dimensions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,expanded in the Wave Motion Engine, along its line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The micro black holes created by super gravity\Nrelease Hawking radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean the entire ship is a giant cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, but close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we'll need to test fire the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll test the warp in the low gravity interference area past Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The test is set for 0130. Everyone, suit up, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasha is asleep on Mars, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:06:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch us. We will reach your homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,After a journey to Earth, of 168,000 light years, all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A journey too long to even imagine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave us the courage and hope to survive. We won't let that go to waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, can we really bend space-time itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea! Sometimes, you've just gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Two minutes until test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirm post-warp coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Point S8630, in Uranus's orbit. Coordinate axis set.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:07:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Increasing speed, from 12 to 33 s-knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Increase engine output.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise output from 40 to 99.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Engine internal pressure rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed is 30 s-knots...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,33 s-knots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute until test.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship sets sail, and the smoke stays behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The smoke that stays behind causes the throat to ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go! It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he does come from a family of priests, that chant is still pretty morbid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed is 36 s-knots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,10...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,9...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,8...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:07:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,7...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,6...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,5...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,4...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,3...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,2...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,1...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jupiter...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shima!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, report!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The space-time coordinates were right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,An unknown obstacle was detected in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It may have been an attempt to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is caught in Jupiter's gravity field!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good. It's drawing us in...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine room, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The main engine isn't transferring energy correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try switching to sub-engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Power flowing to the sub-engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploying stabilizer wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of it, Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing something on radar. 65,000 kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a ship. It's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnify.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching to infrared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That floating object is nearly the size of Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, soft land the Yamato on the floating continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we've located the cause of the engine trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The main engine's coolant system is overheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin repairs immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, put a team together from the deck crew, and go collect samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,AU09, it's your turn to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me by number.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a free unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is autonomous?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,AU09, the Yamato's autonomous sub-computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Analyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, finish your work soon, and come home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Shultz...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ganz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A message from Larleta, at the Floating Continent base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,From planet five, Zupist?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. The Teron ship has landed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It should still be wandering the inner solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:13:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, apparently, they have also seen traces of a Geschtam Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me they jumped?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say for certain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What of the Floating Continent's fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a resupply base. Presently, only four ships are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have Larleta use those ships to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall dispatch the combat fleet immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Teron weapons cannot pierce our armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Four is practically overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunting for plants... Feels like I'm back in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Temperature and pressure are far different than on Jupiter's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Atmospheric composition: Methane 67%..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitrogen 6%. Carbon dioxide 21%.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Detecting acetaldehyde and ethanol, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alcohol, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I'm kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp sickness, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Want a drink, to dull the pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,DNA match with unknown, extraterrestrial plants now living on Earth is 99.98%.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, this environment was imported, from outside the solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They moved this entire continent to Jupiter, to aid in gamilasforming Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:15:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships on radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gamilas vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew to battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire main guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Kodai, until the main engine is fixed, we can't route energy to the guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Type-3 rounds are bullets. We can fire them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Type-3 are for short range!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If we had shock cannons, we could shoot them from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we could use a bypass to fire a few rounds from the shock cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The repairs will be done in five minutes. Can you hold out that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time. Connect the bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Route power to main guns.\NReady Type-3 artillery in secondary guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy transferred to main guns. We can fire shock cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One and two, aim for the destroyers approaching on port side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, prepare to fire at the ship circling around from aft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Target locked. Auto-tracking enabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Torpedoes approaching from port!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,AA defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy torpedoes downed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships now within range of Type-3 rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondary guns, open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship in retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the engine room. Repairs complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate engine. Raise anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're reaching the continent's edge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're 23,000 kilometers from the floating continent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, fire the Wave Motion Gun at the floating continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We will test fire the Wave Motion Gun,\Nand destroy the enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know how powerful the Wave Motion Gun is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Without knowing possible effects, using it will be too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try it, Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't do it here, we won't be able to test it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, stand by to open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the ship around. Point bow at the floating continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching ship to emergency power, in preparation for reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, transfer control to Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Transferring to Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer has control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori, what heat sources are visible on the continent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.03,0:18:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're concentrated in the basin, at the continent's center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Send the coordinates... Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger! Pointing bow at continent's center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Open circuit to the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Opening circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealing emergency vents. Activating force injector.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Release safety lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing safety lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed activation of force injector. Final safety released.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Target scope open!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tachyon particle pressure rising in chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,86, 97, 100...\NEnergy charge at 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Floating continent is 23,000 kilometers off the bow. Relative speed 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow is level with firing axis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct for target errors +2 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage anti-shock and anti-flare defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:20:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Electronic cross-gauge, display brightness twenty. Target locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds until fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,9...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,8...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,7...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,6...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,5...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,4...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,3...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,2...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,1...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Wave Motion Gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,An amazing weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, we can fight the Gamilans on even terms...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we have the advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we only wanted to destroy the Gamilas base.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Wave Motion Gun destroyed the entire continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Our objective isn't to exterminate the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato's weaponry exists solely for self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.59,0:22:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A power that could destroy the universe itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we attained the forbidden fire of Megiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't think of that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is a trial, we need only show the correct path in our actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.94,0:24:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Its terrifying power has damaged the Yamato itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.03,0:24:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A mysterious distress call...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Different feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What will the man of the sea decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.04,0:24:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kodai sees a hero, who rests upon a frozen satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A requiem sounds in empty space.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.51,0:24:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Gravestone on a Frozen Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 363 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:23:00.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The unknown calls to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:12.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Does your courage burn to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:15.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}We rush on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:18.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}For everyone to survive together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}For happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:27.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Though there is pain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:35.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}We will not be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:40.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Those who know the beautiful Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:45.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Restore its wonders
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bring it back, bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:52.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The road to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Determined to reach our destination
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:30.00,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1500,2000)}{\pos(1399,840)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:30.00,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1500,2000)}{\pos(1007,1073)}Escape from the Jupiter Sphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:21.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:28.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:36.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:42.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:47.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.66,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:59.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:24.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
